	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Multa mihi ad te essent scribenda, si modo tantum esset <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>mihi et ocii et facultatis, ut praestare omnia possem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Electus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>erat a nobis d. <persName ref="p2919">Michael Schlatterus</persName>, ut succederet <persName>Mauritio</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>in diaconatu; vocatus est is a senatu et bis auditus; <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>nunc cum confirmationem speramus, a senatu nobis insciis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>evocatur alius, <placeName>Muretensis</placeName> minister, ut et is quoque audiatur.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Is cras concionabitur; postea alterius fiet confirmatio.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sed ego <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>de <persName ref="p2919">Michaele</persName> plane iam desperavi, nisi dominus mirabiliter suam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>exerat potentiam.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Placuit quidem omnibus, quotquot ego audivi; sed <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>omnia haec claviculę<note type="margin">a.R.: ...</note> consulis et Aethyopis nostri impediuntur machinis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Quęrit is clavicula tales, qui sibi aures prurientes defricent <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>et qui ei in promovendo foedere <placeName ref="l832">Gallico</placeName> non adversentur; hoc unum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>perversis istis quaeritur electionibus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2919">Michael</persName> oberit, quod pro <placeName ref="l587">Ti<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>gurino</placeName> habetur; adeo enim ardet animus huius hominis contra <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ut in faciem etiam <persName ref="p2919">Michaeli</persName> dixerit: <foreign xml:lang="de">"Die Zürcher predicanten <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sind unruͤwig, schribend vil hin und wider, steckend sich in all sachen, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>und was gand uns die v[on] <placeName ref="l587">Z[ürich]</placeName> an?</foreign></s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Wir sind als wol ein ort <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>als si.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Machind si, was si wellind, und laßind uns auch machen, was uns guͦt <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>dunckt."</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Haec ipse, et tales quoque cum ipso sunt multi alii.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Volunt <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ergo habere <placeName ref="l41">Bernates</placeName> et tales, qui ipsis dicant placentia.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quid mihi interea <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ferendum sit, potes ipse cogitare.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Accrescit in me quoque in dies ipsorum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>odium, quod tamen in domino et per domini gratiam facile contemno.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Nisi tamen <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>mihi <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> suis adesset consolationibus, interdum deficerem.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Omne huius <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ecclesię onus magis ac magis in me devolvitur, quod tamen facilius sufferem, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>nisi diabolica ista et subdola privatorum essent odia.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Oro tamen dominum, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ut is mihi det patientiam et fortitudinem talia perferendi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Captabunt <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>occasiones quascunque me quoque tandem eiiciendi, ne ipsorum obstem conatibus.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Sed dominus iniqua ipsorum franget consilia.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Man sagt hie, min herren <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> habind das fridgält abgsagt, schickind auch nieman uff den <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>tag, gipt vil redens.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Lieber, land mich wüßen, wie es stand.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Nüws ist nüt bsonders, dann das der keiser 2 stürm an <placeName ref="l322">Metz</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>sol verloren han.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">Die Eidgnoßen sond sich auch der Frantzosen <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>neißwan an eim ort han muͤßen erweeren; doch ist nüt gwüß.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Was ir hand, das lond uns wüßen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Quod praedestinationis negotium <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>concernit, serpit hoc indies latius.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Nos quantum possumus <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>supprimimus et compescimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Ferunt quidam d. <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandrum</persName> scrip<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>turum contra <persName ref="p540">Calvinum</persName>: quod ne fiat etiam atque etiam oro.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Tu tua <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>te interpone prudentia et authoritate quantum potes.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Poterit <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>aliter quam publice <persName ref="p540">Calvinus</persName> modestię admoneri.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l280">Lausan[n]<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>enses</placeName> tria constituerunt axiomata, quibus cum omnes praeter <lb xml:id="p1z43"/><persName>Franciscum S.Paulinum</persName> <placeName ref="l952">Viviacensem</placeName> ministrum subscripserint, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>ipsum vix ferre possunt.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Sunt autem axiomata haec: 1. <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>Deus ab aeterno non tantum praecognovit sed etiam decrevit, non <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>tantum indefinite, ut quicunque crederent servarentur, sed definite, <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>ut certi homines nascerentur quos servaret per fidem <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>in Christum, quique nunquam desciscerent a fide.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">2. <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>Eadem ratione deus ab aeterno etiam decrevit definite ut <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>certi homines nascerentur ad interitum, quos nunquam <lb xml:id="p1z51"/>donaret spiritu regenerationis et fidei <foreign xml:lang="el">πληροφορία</foreign>.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">3. <lb xml:id="p1z52"/>Damnationis culpa in solo homine quaerenda est, et tamen dicimus <lb xml:id="p1z53"/>dei decretum praecedere, cum sit aeternum, sine culpa tamen: <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>quia, etsi causa aeterni decreti est nobis incognita, iusta tamen est, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>quum dei voluntas sit certa et sola iustitię regula.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Quę vero <persName ref="p5497">Francisci</persName> sit sententia ex hoc scripto apposito cogno<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>sces.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Nos et ad classem et ad <persName ref="p5497">Franciscum</persName> scripsimus, et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>utramque partem ad concordiam cohortati sumus, indigne ferentes <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ipsos nova constituere pronunciata, quibus qui non subscriberent <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>vexare vellent.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Non esse hanc pacis sed multarum turbarum <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>viam.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Et spero nos aliquid profecisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Volui hęc tibi significare, <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>ut saltem gustum eorum quę hac in causa hic geruntur haberes, et <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>futuris quoque tanto melius prospiceres.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la">Tu, quod semper oro, quę <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>scribo, boni consulito.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la">Cogor mihi suffurari semper tantum temporis, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>ad amicos ut scribere queam; deinde confidentius et liberius <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ad te omnia scribo minoreque diligentia, quia prae omnibus aliis te tanqua<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>m patrem diligo et veneror.</s>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la">Dominus tibi semper adsit teque servet ecclesię suę incolumem!</s>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat te <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName>; saluta e me <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>tuos omnes.</s>
					<s n="43" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 14. decembris 1552.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="44" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p8018">Io[annes] Hallerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="45" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesię fidelissimo pastori, domino et compatri suo colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="46" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="47" xml:lang="de">M. <persName ref="p495">Heinrych Bullingeren</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
